\section{Sandboxing model}{

The security model uses webR's isolation with controlled host directory
access:
\itemize{
\item \strong{Main code}: Runs without access to the \code{stage} directory
\item \strong{Prologue/Epilogue code}: Has access to \code{stage} for data transfer
\item \strong{binds}: Host directories mounted and available to all phases
\item \strong{r_libs}: Mounted R package library available to all phases
}
}

